|YKB'Few animals have ever existed as powerful as the Dragon.'|WKO - 
|RKBMadam Ki Chim|YK0

The powerful Dragon form brings more with it than a harder body
and larger muscles. While one with the Dragon, a Monk is able
to harden their skin akin to the scales of a mighty Dragon. 
This skill turns the Monk into somewhat of a juggernaught; while
toughening themselves up and possessing the ability to withstand
fire attacks, they will not be able to move quite as fast
before.

|BKBThis is a Grand Master power.

